en groups, with p<0.05 considered statistically significant\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In keeping with Office of the Global AIDS Coordinator (OGAC) methodology, the new HIV diagnosis rate was calculated using the formula\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The difference in the percentage reduction among adolescent girls and young women in DREAMS versus non-DREAMS districts was statistically significant (p = 0.002).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}